      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-20T04:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think the change provides enough context for me to understand whether this is correct or not, but it looks suspicious :\n\n- These are strings and you\u0027re testing for reference equality rather than equals(). Is this really what you want ?\n- It looks to me like you\u0027re managing state and triggering a change when the response changes, but if there used to be a value in mSilentProvisioningResponse and the new one is empty, then you return without resetting mSilentProvisioningResponse. Is this really what you want ? ISTM you should unregister the receiver if that happens.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 156,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 157,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "2adff45ce493db10235823b041e1d6d60da51888",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
