      "writtenOn": "2019-03-20T04:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this needs comments to give a hint of what is happening here. I had to go through the entire log of the bug you pointed out to understand.\n\nSuggested wording :\n\nAfter not being used for a few days (as can easily be the case for tethering) the entitlement app might have been put into the \"app standby\" mode. That would prevent it from accessing the network in the background, making it impossible for it to silently check for provisioning. Therefore, forcibly move the provisioning app out of app standby mode to let it access the network silently.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 400,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 400,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "2adff45ce493db10235823b041e1d6d60da51888",
